    "title": "다크모드 프리미엄 피트니스 VIBE FIT 랜딩페이지 (모바일 & 데스크톱 반응형)",
    "fileData": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>VIBE FIT 프리미엄 피트니스</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between\">\n  <nav class=\"bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-slate-800 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-black text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-2xl\">⚡</span> VIBE FIT\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <a href=\"#programs\" class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-300 hover:text-white hidden sm:inline\">프로그램</a>\n      <button onclick=\"document.getElementById('trialModal').classList.remove('hidden')\" class=\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-400 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md transition\">\n        1일 무료체험 신청\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <header class=\"py-12 sm:py-20 text-center px-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-slate-950 relative overflow-hidden\">\n    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-xs font-bold mb-4\">\n      <span>🔥</span> 동구 최고 시설 프리미엄 헬스 & 피트니스\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-white\">\n      한계를 뛰어넘는 변화,<br><span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-500\">VIBE FIT에서 시작하세요</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-base mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto\">\n      최고급 해머스트렝스 머신 50종과 국가대표 출신 트레이너의 1:1 맞춤형 밀착 코칭.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"mt-6 flex justify-center gap-3\">\n      <button onclick=\"document.getElementById('trialModal').classList.remove('hidden')\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-lg transition\">\n        1일 무료 패스 받기 ↗\n      </button>\n      <a href=\"#programs\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm transition\">\n        프로그램 보기\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section id=\"programs\" class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 sm:py-12 w-full\">\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-8\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white\">전문 트레이닝 프로그램</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1\">목적에 맞춘 체계적인 커리큘럼</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6\">\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"text-4xl\">🏋️</div>\n        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-white\">1:1 개인 PT</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">체형 분석 및 인바디 데이터를 기반으로 한 체계적인 식단과 고효율 맞춤 운동</p>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold block\">체지방 감량 · 근력 강화</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"text-4xl\">🧘</div>\n        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-white\">기구 필라테스</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">체형 교정과 코어 강화를 위한 캐딜락, 리포머 소수 정예 1:4 그룹 수업</p>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold block\">자세 교정 · 유연성 향상</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bg-slate-900 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition space-y-3\">\n        <div class=\"text-4xl\">⚡</div>\n        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base sm:text-lg text-white\">크로스 트레이닝</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">심폐 지구력과 전신 파워를 극대화하는 고강도 인터벌 서킷 트레이닝</p>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 font-bold block\">체력 증진 · 칼로리 폭탄</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div id=\"trialModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 flex items-center justify-center p-4\">\n    <div class=\"bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 max-w-sm w-full border border-slate-700 space-y-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base text-white\">⚡ 1일 무료 체험권 신청</h3>\n        <button onclick=\"document.getElementById('trialModal').classList.add('hidden')\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-white\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n      <form onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); alert('🎉 신청이 완료되었습니다! 안내 문자가 발송됩니다.'); document.getElementById('trialModal').classList.add('hidden');\" class=\"space-y-3 text-xs\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 mb-1\">성함</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" required placeholder=\"홍길동\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-700\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-slate-300 mb-1\">연락처</label>\n          <input type=\"tel\" required placeholder=\"010-0000-0000\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-700\">\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 font-bold text-slate-950 mt-2\">체험권 신청 완료</button>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 py-6 px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-1\">\n    <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-300\">VIBE FIT (동구평생학습관 2회차 Netlify 배포 실습작품)</p>\n    <p>대전광역시 동구 중앙로 | 문의: 042-000-0000</p>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
