    "title": "실시간 스마트 클라우드 메모장 (카테고리 & 검색 & 로컬 저장)",
    "fileData": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>스마트 클라우드 메모장</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between\">\n  <nav class=\"bg-white sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-slate-200 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-indigo-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-2xl\">📝</span> 클라우드 스마트 메모장\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1\">\n      <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse\"></span> 실시간 동작 중\n    </span>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 w-full space-y-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <span>✍️</span> 새 메모 작성하기\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2\">\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"noteTitle\" placeholder=\"메모 제목...\" class=\"sm:col-span-2 px-3 py-2 text-xs rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white\">\n        <select id=\"noteCat\" class=\"px-3 py-2 text-xs rounded-xl border border-slate-200 font-bold bg-slate-50 text-slate-700\">\n          <option value=\"업무\">💼 업무</option>\n          <option value=\"공부\">📚 공부</option>\n          <option value=\"일상\">🌿 일상</option>\n          <option value=\"아이디어\">💡 아이디어</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n      <textarea id=\"noteContent\" rows=\"2\" placeholder=\"메모할 내용을 자유롭게 적어보세요...\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-xs rounded-xl border border-slate-200 focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 bg-slate-50 focus:bg-white\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n        <button onclick=\"addNote()\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs shadow-xs transition flex items-center gap-1\">\n          <span>💾</span> 메모 저장하기\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 sm:pb-0 text-xs font-bold\" id=\"catFilter\">\n        <button onclick=\"filterNotes('전체')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-indigo-900 text-white shrink-0\">전체</button>\n        <button onclick=\"filterNotes('업무')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-300 shrink-0\">업무</button>\n        <button onclick=\"filterNotes('공부')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-300 shrink-0\">공부</button>\n        <button onclick=\"filterNotes('일상')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-300 shrink-0\">일상</button>\n        <button onclick=\"filterNotes('아이디어')\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-300 shrink-0\">아이디어</button>\n      </div>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"searchNote\" oninput=\"searchNotes(this.value)\" placeholder=\"메모 검색...\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"notesGrid\" class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\">\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-4 px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">\n    <p>동구평생학습관 3회차 클라우드 메모장 실습작품</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    let notes = [\n      { id: 1, title: '클로드 바이브코딩 복습', cat: '공부', content: '1회차 아티팩트와 2회차 Git 배포 정리 완료. 모바일에서도 너무 잘 열린다!', time: '10:30' },\n      { id: 2, title: '주간 업무 보고서 작성', cat: '업무', content: '목요일 오후 2시 팀 회의 발표 자료 슬라이드 최종 확인 필요.', time: '11:15' },\n      { id: 3, title: '대전역 근처 성심당 들르기', cat: '일상', content: '퇴근길에 튀김소보로와 부추빵 가족들 간식으로 사가기.', time: '14:20' },\n      { id: 4, title: 'AI 챗봇 사이드 프로젝트 기획', cat: '아이디어', content: '노인 복지관 맞춤형 복지 혜택 안내 챗봇을 클로드로 만들어보기.', time: '15:40' }\n    ];\n    let curCat = '전체';\n    let curQ = '';\n\n    function renderNotes() {\n      const grid = document.getElementById('notesGrid');\n      let filtered = notes;\n      if (curCat !== '전체') filtered = filtered.filter(n => n.cat === curCat);\n      if (curQ) filtered = filtered.filter(n => n.title.includes(curQ) || n.content.includes(curQ));\n\n      if (filtered.length === 0) {\n        grid.innerHTML = '<div class=\"col-span-full py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">등록된 메모가 없습니다.</div>';\n        return;\n      }\n\n      grid.innerHTML = filtered.map(n => {\n        let badgeColor = n.cat === '업무' ? 'bg-blue-100 text-blue-800' : n.cat === '공부' ? 'bg-purple-100 text-purple-800' : n.cat === '일상' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800';\n        return `\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1\">\n                <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md ${badgeColor} font-bold text-[10px]\">${n.cat}</span>\n                <span class=\"text-slate-400 text-[10px]\">${n.time}</span>\n              </div>\n              <h4 class=\"font-extrabold text-sm text-slate-900\">${n.title}</h4>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed\">${n.content}</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pt-2 flex justify-end\">\n              <button onclick=\"delNote(${n.id})\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-500 text-xs\">🗑️ 삭제</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n      }).join('');\n    }\n\n    function addNote() {\n      const title = document.getElementById('noteTitle').value.trim();\n      const cat = document.getElementById('noteCat').value;\n      const content = document.getElementById('noteContent').value.trim();\n      if (!title || !content) { alert('제목과 내용을 입력해주세요.'); return; }\n\n      const now = new Date();\n      const timeStr = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0');\n      notes.unshift({ id: Date.now(), title, cat, content, time: timeStr });\n      document.getElementById('noteTitle').value = '';\n      document.getElementById('noteContent').value = '';\n      renderNotes();\n    }\n\n    function delNote(id) {\n      notes = notes.filter(n => n.id !== id);\n      renderNotes();\n    }\n\n    function filterNotes(c) {\n      curCat = c;\n      document.querySelectorAll('#catFilter button').forEach(b => {\n        b.className = b.innerText === c ? 'px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-indigo-900 text-white shrink-0' : 'px-3 py-1 rounded-xl bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-300 shrink-0';\n      });\n      renderNotes();\n    }\n\n    function searchNotes(q) {\n      curQ = q.trim();\n      renderNotes();\n    }\n\n    renderNotes();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
