    "title": "나만의 스마트 일정 캘린더 & To-Do 플래너 (수료 작품 & 실시간 실행)",
    "fileData": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>스마트 일정 & To-Do 플래너</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-indigo-50/50 text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between\">\n  <nav class=\"bg-white sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-indigo-100 px-4 sm:px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-indigo-950 flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-2xl\">📅</span> 스마트 플래너 2026\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">\n      수료 최종 포트폴리오\n    </span>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 w-full space-y-5\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 border border-indigo-100 shadow-xs space-y-2\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-black\">\n        <span class=\"text-slate-900\">오늘의 할 일 진행률</span>\n        <span id=\"rateText\" class=\"text-indigo-600 font-extrabold\">50% 달성</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w-full bg-slate-100 h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n        <div id=\"rateBar\" class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width: 50%;\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"todoInput\" placeholder=\"새로운 할 일 또는 약속 추가...\" class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 bg-white shadow-2xs focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n      <button onclick=\"addTodo()\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs transition shrink-0\">\n        + 추가\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-2.5\" id=\"todoList\">\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"bg-white border-t border-indigo-100 py-4 px-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\">\n    <p>동구평생학습관 5회차 최종 수료 과제 완성 포트폴리오</p>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    let todos = [\n      { id: 1, text: '클로드 바이브코딩 교안 복습하기', done: true },\n      { id: 2, text: '나만의 웹사이트 Netlify 무료 배포 완료', done: true },\n      { id: 3, text: '스마트폰으로 가족들에게 완성 사이트 링크 공유하기', done: false },\n      { id: 4, text: '동구평생학습관 종강 발표 자료 준비', done: false }\n    ];\n\n    function renderTodos() {\n      const list = document.getElementById('todoList');\n      list.innerHTML = todos.map(t => `\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3 transition ${t.done ? 'bg-slate-50 opacity-70' : ''}\">\n          <label class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer flex-1 min-w-0\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" onchange=\"toggleTodo(${t.id})\" ${t.done ? 'checked' : ''} class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-md text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 cursor-pointer\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 truncate ${t.done ? 'line-through text-slate-400' : ''}\">${t.text}</span>\n          </label>\n          <button onclick=\"deleteTodo(${t.id})\" class=\"text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-500 text-xs shrink-0 p-1\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n      `).join('');\n\n      const total = todos.length;\n      const doneCount = todos.filter(t => t.done).length;\n      const pct = total === 0 ? 0 : Math.round((doneCount / total) * 100);\n      document.getElementById('rateText').innerText = pct + '% 달성 (' + doneCount + '/' + total + ')';\n      document.getElementById('rateBar').style.width = pct + '%';\n    }\n\n    function toggleTodo(id) {\n      const item = todos.find(t => t.id === id);\n      if (item) {\n        item.done = !item.done;\n        renderTodos();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function addTodo() {\n      const input = document.getElementById('todoInput');\n      const text = input.value.trim();\n      if (!text) return;\n      todos.push({ id: Date.now(), text, done: false });\n      input.value = '';\n      renderTodos();\n    }\n\n    function deleteTodo(id) {\n      todos = todos.filter(t => t.id !== id);\n      renderTodos();\n    }\n\n    renderTodos();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "content": "smart_planner.html 파일 직접 업로드 (실시간 웹 실행 지원)",
